**component_loader.hpp does component registration, lookup, lifecycle control, dynamic imports, and shutdown signaling.**

## API

`component_loader` exports `premature_shutdown_trigger` (`std::exception`, `what()` → `"Premature shutdown requested"`), `installer<T>` (static-asserts `T : component_interface`, registers `std::make_unique<T>()`), and `get<T>()` → `T*`.

`register_component(std::unique_ptr<component_interface>&&)`; `post_start()`/`post_load()` → `bool`; `pre_destroy()`/`clean()` → `void`; `load_import(const std::string&, const std::string&)` → `void*`; `trigger_premature_shutdown()` → `void`; `get_components()` → `std::vector<std::unique_ptr<component_interface>>&`.

## Registration

`REGISTER_COMPONENT(name)` creates an anonymous-namespace static `component_loader::installer<name>`. `get<T>()` matches exact `typeid` and returns `nullptr` when absent.